---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Image from "astro/components/Image.astro";

import Cian from '../../assets/images/Board/Cian.jpeg';

import ads_flaps from "../../assets/images/Avionics/ads_flaps.gif";
import flaps_ground from "../../assets/images/Avionics/flaps-ground.gif";
import me_boys from "../../assets/images/Avionics/me_boys.jpeg";
import me_rocket from "../../assets/images/Avionics/me_rocket.jpg";
import old_ads_pcb from "../../assets/images/Avionics/old-ads-pcb.png";
---

<style>
  .masonry {
    column-count: 2;
    column-gap: 1rem;
  }
  .masonry-item {
    break-inside: avoid;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .masonry {
    column-count: 1;
  }
  .container,
  section.container {
    padding-left: 0.5rem !important;
    padding-right: 0.5rem !important;
  }
  .text-lg {
    padding-left: 0 !important;
    padding-right: 0 !important;
  }
  .py-8 {
    padding-top: 1.5rem !important;
    padding-bottom: 1.5rem !important;
  }
  .px-32 {
    padding-left: 0 !important;
    padding-right: 0 !important;
  }
  h1.text-6xl {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    line-height: 1.1;
    word-break: break-word;
  }
}
</style>

<BaseLayout pageTitle="Avionics | Rocketry at Virginia Tech">
<section class="container mx-auto px-4 md:px-32 py-8 text-center">
  <h1 class="text-6xl font-bold mb-8">Avionics</h1>
  <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start mb-8">
    <div class="md:w-4/12 p-4">
      <Image
        src={Cian}
        alt="Cian Capacci"
        class="w-full h-auto mb-4"
      />
      <p class="text-lg text-left">
        <span class="font-bold">Team Lead:</span> Cian Capacci<br />Senior
        in Computer Engineering
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="md:w-4/5 p-4">
      <p class="text-lg text-left">
      The Avionics subteam is responsible for the rocket’s full hardware and software design/implementation. Some of our major projects include the flight controller PCB, payload electronics, recovery bay wiring, battery integration, ground station systems, and experimental telemetry and RF designs. 
      </p>
      <p class="text-lg text-left mt-4">
        The overall objective for Avionics this year is to continue progressing efforts towards the development of our long-range telemetry, flight control software, and ground station. Rocketry has come a long way in the past few years. From using off-the-shelf hardware and basic levels of programming to fully custom hardware designs and complex embedded systems. The motto this year is to “test early and often”, for we strive to make the critical mistakes in the lab before we throw them in the rocket. Members will gain invaluable experience designing real aerospace hardware and software in ways that can’t be learned in the classroom.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="masonry">
    <div class="masonry-item">
      <Image src={flaps_ground} alt="Flaps Ground Test" class="w-full lg:w-1/2 h-auto" />
      <p class="mt-2 text-left">Flaps Ground Test</p>
    </div>
    <div class="masonry-item">
      <Image src={me_boys} alt="Me and Rocket" class="w-full h-auto" />
      <p class="mt-2 text-left">Spaceport 2024 Avionics</p>
    </div>
    <div class="masonry-item">
      <Image
        src={ads_flaps}
        alt="Active Drag System Flaps"
        class="w-full h-auto"
      />
      <p class="mt-2 text-left">Active Drag System Flaps</p>
    </div>
    <div class="masonry-item">
      <Image src={old_ads_pcb} alt="Old ADS PCB" class="w-full h-auto" />
      <p class="mt-2 text-left">Old ADS PCB</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
